teams-oauth-created = Created SharePoint remote `{ $name }` for the verified library. Signed-in account: { $account }. Run Test Connection, then Save Connection.
teams-oauth-editor-changed = Created SharePoint remote `{ $name }`, but the editor changed during authorization. Select it and test the current library before saving.
teams-oauth-create-failed = Could not create SharePoint remote: { $error } The existing remotes were left unchanged.
teams-oauth-wait-test = Wait for Microsoft sign-in to finish before testing.
teams-oauth-wait-save = Wait for Microsoft sign-in to finish before saving.
teams-oauth-teams-only = Microsoft sign-in is only available for SharePoint connections.
teams-oauth-opening = Opening Microsoft browser sign-in for new SharePoint remote `{ $name }`. Select your work account; the library URL will be verified before this remote can be saved.
teams-oauth-invalid-name = Enter a new rclone remote name using letters, digits, _, -, or .
