ui-app-automatic-synchronization-is-paused-on-metered-networks = automatic synchronization is paused on metered networks
ui-app-background-sync-is-paused-on-metered-networks = background sync is paused on metered networks by policy
ui-app-background-sync-is-waiting-for-network-readiness = background sync is waiting for network readiness
ui-app-background-sync-is-waiting-for-vpn-readiness = background sync is waiting for VPN readiness
ui-app-background-sync-requires-a-successful-preview-and = background sync requires a successful Preview and confirmed initial Sync Now first
ui-app-background-sync-timer-started-use-sync-now = Background sync timer started. Use Sync Now for an immediate one-shot sync.
ui-app-background-sync-timer-stopped-manual-sync-now = Background sync timer stopped. Manual Sync Now remains available.
